    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever fantasized about a towering woman dominating you completely? What if you were no bigger than her toe\u2026 and she <i>knew</i> exactly how to use that to her advantage?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705300/extras/1aef9416074a61456282cfb9aa3ed45f.avif?t=1749750596\" width=614 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a surreal and steamy world of size-play and submission, where you shrink down and experience the ultimate power dynamic shift. Meet Chloe \u2014 a statuesque, seductive giantess with a wicked smile and a love for turning men into her obedient little toys. She doesn\u2019t just dominate\u2026 she <i>enjoys</i> it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705300/extras/85ccb6655043fa1be9a4f1a6f6639e85.avif?t=1749750596\" width=614 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This visual novel features two unforgettable stories that dive deep into erotic size-fantasy scenarios \u2014 from teasing and torment to total surrender. Whether you dream of being gently toyed with or ruthlessly used, Chloe is ready to make that fantasy come true\u2026 on her terms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong><br>\ud83d\udc63 A unique and provocative size-fantasy storyline<br>\ud83c\udf99\ufe0f Fully voiced characters who bring the seduction to life<br>\ud83d\udd0d Zoom mode for exploring every delicious detail up close<br>\ud83d\udd25 Dozens of explicit and imaginative scenes to satisfy your inner size-kink</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705300/extras/0557f5a96a43b2229b8004a8e17b3703.avif?t=1749750596\" width=614 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful what you fantasize about \u2014 Chloe might just make it come true. And once you're between her toes\u2026 there's no going back.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever fantasized about a towering woman dominating you completely? What if you were no bigger than her toe\u2026 and she <i>knew</i> exactly how to use that to her advantage?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705300/extras/1aef9416074a61456282cfb9aa3ed45f.avif?t=1749750596\" width=614 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a surreal and steamy world of size-play and submission, where you shrink down and experience the ultimate power dynamic shift. Meet Chloe \u2014 a statuesque, seductive giantess with a wicked smile and a love for turning men into her obedient little toys. She doesn\u2019t just dominate\u2026 she <i>enjoys</i> it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705300/extras/85ccb6655043fa1be9a4f1a6f6639e85.avif?t=1749750596\" width=614 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This visual novel features two unforgettable stories that dive deep into erotic size-fantasy scenarios \u2014 from teasing and torment to total surrender. Whether you dream of being gently toyed with or ruthlessly used, Chloe is ready to make that fantasy come true\u2026 on her terms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong><br>\ud83d\udc63 A unique and provocative size-fantasy storyline<br>\ud83c\udf99\ufe0f Fully voiced characters who bring the seduction to life<br>\ud83d\udd0d Zoom mode for exploring every delicious detail up close<br>\ud83d\udd25 Dozens of explicit and imaginative scenes to satisfy your inner size-kink</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705300/extras/0557f5a96a43b2229b8004a8e17b3703.avif?t=1749750596\" width=614 hei